<title>HONG KONG: Safety Godown interim net up 162.45 pct.</title>
<headline>Safety Godown interim net up 162.45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   57.0	 vs  22.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    20.0	 vs  18.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  60.28 gain vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    77.32	vs  29.46</p>
<p>    Turnover		     53.21	vs  71.74</p>
<p>    Company name		 Safety Godown Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Dec 31, 1996 to Jan 7, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Jan 8, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Safety Godown is involved in warehousing, property development and share investment.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of godown premises.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
